uenti le rimanenze al &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;31.12.2019&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt; ammontanti a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;€ 2.757.840 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;sono iscritti al minore tra il costo di acquisto e il valore di realizzo desumibile dall’&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;andamento di mercato.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="5" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;I singoli crediti verso la clientela, che si evidenziano nell’&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;attivo, sono iscritti al loro valore nominale al netto della svalutazione effettuata nei limiti consentiti dalla normativa vigente ammontante a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;€ 70.377.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="6" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;Le disponibilità liquide sono iscritte per il loro effettivo importo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="7" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;I ratei e i risconti sono iscritti sulla base del principio di competenza temporale dei costi e dei proventi comuni a più esercizi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="8" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;Non esistono fondi a fronte di imposte in contenzioso.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="9" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;I debiti risultano iscritti per importi corrispondenti al loro valore nominale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol type="a" start="10" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;text-align:justify;margin:0px 37.8000005086263px 0px -0.733332316080727px ;text-indent:-4.33333333333333px ;line-height:150% ;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new roman;"&gt;I ricavi e i costi sono stati determinati secondo il principio di prudenza e competenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;font-family:times new 